  "restatement": "You want to see oEE by line, from 22 Dec 2025 to 28 Dec 2025. Defined as: oEE is a proposed definition from sightline's KPI library (ISO 22400-2:2014, key performance indicators for manufacturing operations management), not yet approved: availability (actual production time (run hours) over planned busy time (planned busy hours)) times effectiveness (ideal production time (ideal hours) over actual production time (run hours)) times quality ratio (good quantity over produced quantity).",
